msgid "cookie"
msgstr "cookie"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cookies are a mechanism used by web sites to store and retrieve information "
"using your browser. For example, a web site may allow you to customize the "
"content and layout of the pages you see, so that your choices are persistent "
"across different visits to that web site."
msgstr ""
"As cookies son un mecanismo usado polos sitios web para gardar e recuperar "
"información mediante o navegador. Por exemplo un sitio web podería "
"permitirlle personaliza o contido e a aparencia das páxinas que ve, e as "
"escollas poderían conservarse nas distintas visitas a tal sitio web."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The web site is able to remember your preferences by storing a cookie on "
"your computer. Then, on future visits, the web site retrieves the "
"information stored in the cookie to format the content of the site according "
"to your previously specified preferences."
msgstr ""
"O sitio web pode lembrar as súa preferencias gardando unha cookie no "
"computador. Nas vindeiras visitas recuperará a información gardada nesa "
"cookie para formatar o contido do sitio segundo as preferencias que indicase "
"anteriormente."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Thus, cookies play a very useful role in web browsing. Unfortunately, web "
"sites often store and retrieve information in cookies without your explicit "
"knowledge or consent. Some of this information may be quite useful to the "
"web site owners, for example, by allowing them to collect summary statistics "
"on the number of visits different areas of the web sites get, or to "
"customize banner advertising."
msgstr ""
"As cookies teñen un papel moi importante na navegación da web, pero por "
"desgraza os sitios gardan a miúdo, e recuperan, información nelas sen o "
"coñecemento nin o consentimento explícito do usuario. Algunha desta "
"información pode ser moi útil para o dono do sitio web, por exemplo "
"permitíndolles recoller estatísticas do número de visitas a distintas áreas "
"da web, ou personalizando os anuncios."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The cookies module of the &systemsettings; allows you to set policies for "
#| "the use of cookies when you are browsing the web with the &konqueror; web "
#| "browser."
msgid ""
"The cookies page allows you to set policies for the use of cookies when you "
"are browsing the web with the &konqueror; web browser."
msgstr ""
"O módulo das cookies da &systemsettings; permítelle definir políticas para o "
"uso das cookies cando está a navegar a web co navegador &konqueror;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the policies that you set using this control module will "
"<emphasis>not</emphasis> apply to other web browsers such as &Netscape;."
msgstr ""
"Lembre que as políticas definidas mediante este módulo de control "
"<emphasis>non</emphasis> han aplicarse a outros navegadores web como o "
"&Netscape;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Política"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Policy</guilabel> tab, you can configure the &kde; "
"applications that will handle cookies. You can do this by specifying a "
"general cookie policy as well as special cookie policies for certain domains "
"or hosts."
msgstr ""
"Na lapela <guilabel>Política</guilabel> pode configurar os aplicativos de "
"&kde; que han manexar as cookies. Pode facer isto especificando unha "
"política xeral e políticas especiais para certos dominios ou máquinas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top of the policy tab has a check box labeled <guilabel>Enable cookies</"
"guilabel>. If you leave this unchecked, cookies will be completely disabled. "
"However, this may make browsing rather inconvenient, especially as some web "
"sites require the use of browsers with cookies enabled."
msgstr ""
"Na parte superior da lapela de políticas hai unha caixa para marcar coa "
"etiqueta <guilabel>Activar as cookies</guilabel>. Se a deixa desmarcada "
"desactivaraas de todo, o que pode facer incómoda a navegación en especial "
"nalgúns sitios que requiren activar as cookies."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will probably want to enable cookies and then set specific policies on "
"how you want them to be handled."
msgstr ""
"Probabelmente lle interese activar as cookies e especificar políticas "
"específicas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "The first group of options create settings that apply to all cookies."
msgstr ""
"O primeiro grupo de opcións define parámetros que se han aplicar a todas as "
"cookies."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only accept cookies from originating server"
msgstr "Aceptar só as cookies procedentes o servidor orixinario"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some pages try to set cookies from servers other than the one you are seeing "
"the &HTML; page from. For example, they show you advertisements, and the "
"advertisements are from another computer, often one that belongs to a large "
"advertising group. These advertisements may try to set a cookie which would "
"allow them to track the pages you view across multiple web sites."
msgstr ""
"Algunhas páxinas intentan deixar cookies de servidores distintos do que lle "
"enviou a páxina &HTML;. Por exemplo cando lle mostran anuncios procedentes "
"doutro computador, xeralmente procedente dunha organización grande, e "
"intentan definir unha cookie que lle permita rastrexar as páxinas que ve a "
"través de distintos sitios web."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will mean only cookies that come from the same web "
"server as you are explicitly connecting to will be accepted."
msgstr ""
"Se activa esta opción só se aceptarán as cookies que veñan do mesmo servidor "
"web ao que se conectase explicitamente."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatically accept session cookies"
msgstr "Aceptar automaticamente as cookies de sesión"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An increasingly common use for cookies is not to track your movements across "
"many visits to a web site, but to just follow what you do during one single "
"visit. Session cookies are saved as long as you are looking at the site, and "
"deleted when you leave it."
msgstr ""
"Un uso cada vez máis estendido é non o e seguir os seus movementos entre "
"visitas a unha web, senón seguir o que está a facer nunha mesma visita. As "
"cookies de sesión gárdanse mentres está navegar por un sitio e elimínanse "
"cando o deixa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Web sites can use this information for various things, most commonly it is a "
"convenience so that you do not have to keep logging in to view pages. For "
"example, on a webmail site, without some kind of session <acronym>ID</"
"acronym>, you would have to give your password again for each email you want "
"to read. There are other ways to achieve this, but cookies are simple and "
"very common."
msgstr ""
"Os sitios web poden usar esta información para varias cousas, a máis "
"habitual é ser unha facilidade que evitar ter que acceder constantemente "
"para ver as páxinas. Por exemplo, nun webmail se non houbese algunha clase "
"de <acronym>ID</acronym> de sesión tería que inserir o contrasinal para cada "
"correo que quixese ler. Hai outros xeitos de facer isto, pero as cookies son "
"simples e moi habituais."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option means that session cookies are always accepted, even if "
"you don't accept any other kind, and even if you choose to reject cookies "
"from a particular site, session cookies from that site will be accepted."
msgstr ""
"Se activa esta opción as cookies de sesión aceptaranse sempre, mesmo se non "
"acepta ningunha outra. Aínda que escollese rexeitar as cookies dun sitio "
"concreto, hanse aceptar as cookies de sesión dese sitio."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The section for <guilabel>Default Policy</guilabel> sets some further "
"options that are mutually exclusive &mdash; you can choose only one of these "
"options as the default, but you are free to set a different option for any "
"specific web server."
msgstr ""
"A sección para a <guilabel>Política predeterminada</guilabel> define "
"algunhas opcións excluentes entre si; só pode escoller unha delas como a "
"predeterminada, pero pode escoller outra opción para calquera sitio web "
"específico."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Site specific policies always take precedence over the default policy."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accept all cookies"
msgstr "Aceptar todas as cookies"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, all cookies will be accepted without asking for "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Se escolle esta opción hanse aceptar todas as cookies sen pedir confirmación."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accept until end of session"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cookies will be accepted, but they will expire at the end of the session."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ask for confirmation"
msgstr "Pedir confirmación"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, you will be asked for confirmation every time a "
"cookie is stored or retrieved. You can selectively accept or reject each "
"cookie. The confirmation dialog will also allow you to set a domain specific "
"policy, if you do not want to confirm each cookie for that domain."
msgstr ""
"Se escolle esta opción pediráselle permiso cada vez que se almacene ou "
"recupere unha cookie. Pode aceptar ou rexeitar cada cookie; o diálogo de "
"confirmación tamén lle permite definir unha política específica para o "
"dominio, se non quere confirmar cada cookie dese dominio."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reject all cookies"
msgstr "Rexeitar todas as cookies"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, all cookies will be rejected without asking for "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Se escolle esta opción hanse rexeitar todas as cookies sen pedir "
"confirmación."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In addition to the default policy for handling of cookies, which you can "
#| "set by selecting one of the three options described above, you can also "
#| "set policies for specific host domains using the controls in the "
#| "<guilabel>Domain Specific</guilabel> group."
msgid ""
"In addition to the default policy for handling of cookies, which you can set "
"by selecting one of the three options described above, you can also set "
"policies for specific host domains using the controls in the <guilabel>Site "
"Policy</guilabel> group."
msgstr ""
"Ademais da política predeterminada que escollese nas alternativas descritas "
"antes, tamén pode definir políticas para sitios específicos mediante os "
"controis no grupo <guilabel>Específica de dominios</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Ask, Accept, or Reject policy can be applied to a specific domain by "
#| "clicking on the <guibutton>New...</guibutton> button, which brings up a "
#| "dialog. In this dialog, you can type the name of the domain (with a "
#| "leading dot), then select the policy you want to apply to this domain. "
#| "Note that entries may also get added while you are browsing, if the "
#| "default policy is to ask for confirmation, and you choose a general "
#| "policy for a specific host (for example, by selecting <guilabel>Reject "
#| "all cookies from this domain</guilabel> when asked to confirm a cookie)."
msgid ""
"The Ask, Accept, Accept until end of session, or Reject policy can be "
"applied to a specific domain by clicking on the <guibutton>New...</"
"guibutton> button, which brings up a dialog. In this dialog, you can type "
"the name of the domain (with a leading dot), then select the policy you want "
"to apply to this domain. Note that entries may also get added while you are "
"browsing, if the default policy is to ask for confirmation, and you choose a "
"general policy for a specific host (for example, by selecting "
"<guilabel>Reject</guilabel> when asked to confirm a cookie)."
msgstr ""
"No diálogo que se inicia premendo o botón <guibutton>Nova…</guibutton> ha "
"poder aplicar as políticas de preguntar, aceptar ou rexeitar a un dominio "
"específico. Neste diálogo pode escribir o nome do dominio (cun punto "
"inicial) e escoller a política. Lembre que as entradas tamén poden engadirse "
"mentres navega, se a política predeterminada é pedir confirmación, e escolle "
"unha política xeral para un servidor específico (por exemplo, pode escoller "
"<guilabel>Rexeitar todas as cookies deste dominio</guilabel> cando se lle "
"pida que confirme unha cookie)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also select a specific host domain from the list and click the "
"<guibutton>Change</guibutton> button to choose a different policy for that "
"domain than the one shown in the list."
msgstr ""
"Tamén pode escoller un dominio específico na lista e premer o botón "
"<guibutton>Cambiar</guibutton> para escoller unha política distinta para ese "
"dominio."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a domain specific policy, choose a domain from the list, and then "
"click the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button. The default policy will "
"apply to domains which have been deleted from the list."
msgstr ""
"Para eliminar unha política específica dun dominio escóllao na lista e prema "
"o botón <guibutton>Eliminar</guibutton>. A política predeterminada aplícase "
"aos dominios que se eliminan da lista."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Management"
msgstr "Xestión"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Management</guilabel> tab you can browse and selectively "
"delete cookies that have been set in the past."
msgstr ""
"Na lapela <guilabel>Xestión</guilabel> pode examinar e eliminar "
"recursivamente as cookies que fosen definidas no pasado."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In the upper part of this dialog, you can see a list of domains displayed "
#| "as a tree. Click on the little <guiicon>+</guiicon> next to a domain to "
#| "see all cookies that have been set for this particular target domain. If "
#| "you select one of these cookies, you will notice that its contents will "
#| "show up in the frame <guilabel>Details</guilabel> below."
msgid ""
"In the upper part of this dialog, you can see a list of domains displayed as "
"a tree. Click on the little <guiicon>&gt;</guiicon> next to a domain to see "
"all cookies that have been set for this particular target domain. If you "
"select one of these cookies, you will notice that its contents will show up "
"in the frame <guilabel>Details</guilabel> below."
msgstr ""
"Na parte de riba deste diálogo hai unha lista en árbore da listaxe de "
"dominios. Prema o pequerrechiño <guiicon>+</guiicon> xunto a un dominio para "
"ver todas as cookies que se enviaron desde ese dominio de destino en "
"concreto. Se escolle algunha desas cookies verá o seu contido no recadro "
"<guilabel>Detalles</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button you can now delete the "
"selected cookie. Click <guibutton>Delete All</guibutton> to delete all "
"cookies stored."
msgstr ""
"Se preme o botón <guibutton>Eliminar</guibutton> ha eliminar a cookie "
"escollida. Premendo o botón <guibutton>Eliminar todas</guibutton> ha "
"eliminar todas as cookies gardadas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a domain is selected, you can use <guibutton>Configure Policy</guibutton> "
"to set a site policy."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose <guibutton>Reload List</guibutton> to reload the list from your hard "
"disk. You might want to do this if you have had the module open and are "
"testing web sites, or have made many changes in the module itself."
msgstr ""
"Prema <guibutton>Cargar de novo a lista</guibutton> para cargar a lista "
"desde o disco duro. Pode interesarlle facer isto se tivo o módulo aberto e "
"está a comprobar sitios web, ou se fixo algún cambio no módulo en si."

